OL,3,ATrump arrives in Manila for meeting
OL,4,Awith leaders of India, Japan and
OL,5,AAustralia
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump arrives in
OL,8,Fthe Philippines for the first leg of a
OL,9,Fhigh-profile trip to Asia - images show
OL,10,FAir Force One on the runway and a red
OL,11,Fcarpet being rolled out
OL,13,FIn Manila, Trump will meet South East
OL,14,FAsian leaders and America's "Quad"
OL,15,Fsecurity allies - Japan, Australia and
OL,16,FIndia
OL,18,FOn Wednesday, he will fly to Shenzhen
OL,19,Fto attend a summit of Asia Pacific
OL,20,Fleaders and have nuclear talks with
OL,21,FChinese President Xi Jinping and
OL,22,FRussia's Vladimir Putin
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
